# Gitignored files copied into every new local workspace. .gitignore pattern
# syntax; a file has to already be ignored for a pattern here to select it.
#
# The env file lives with the app that reads it. Next resolves .env from its
# own project directory, which is apps/web now, not the repository root, and a
# copy left at the root is read by nothing.
apps/web/.env*
